<h1>凶暴鼠 (Dire Rat)</h1>
<table class="d chm-compat-grid" style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:20px 0;font-size:14px;background:#fefcf7;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;"><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#eee6d8;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">资料栏位</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#eee6d8;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;">凶暴鼠 (Dire Rat)<br/><small>小型动物</small></td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">生命骰</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">1d8+1(5HP)</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">先攻</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">+3</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">速度</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">40英尺(8格)、攀爬20英尺</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">防御等级</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">15(+1体型、+3敏捷、+1天生)、接触14、措手不及12</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">基本攻击/擒抱</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">+0 / -4</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">攻击</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">啮咬+4近战(1d4附加疾病)</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">全力攻击</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">啮咬+4近战(1d4附加疾病)</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">占据/触及</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">5英尺 / 5英尺</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">特殊攻击</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">疾病</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">特殊能力</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">昏暗视觉、灵敏嗅觉</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">豁免</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">强韧+3、反射+5、意志+3</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">属性</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">力量10、敏捷17、体质12、智力1、感知12、魅力4</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">技能</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">攀爬+11、躲藏+8、聆听+4、潜行+4、侦察+4、游泳+11</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">专长</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">警觉、武器娴熟<sup>B</sup></td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">环境</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">任何</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">组织</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">单独或一批(11-20)</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">挑战级数</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">1/3</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">宝藏</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">无</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">阵营</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">总是绝对中立</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">进化</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">2-3HD(小型)；4-6HD(中型)</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">等级修正值</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">—</td></tr></table>
<p>这些巨鼠看起来比狗还大，也更凶恶。长有粗糙的尖毛，带恶意的眼睛，无毛的长尾巴。</p>
<p>凶暴鼠是杂食性的觅食者，但也会为了保护巢穴与领地而攻击。</p>
<p>凶暴鼠可长至4英尺长，超过50磅重。</p>
<span class="s">战斗</span>
<p>一批凶暴鼠可毫无畏惧地攻击，以尖锐门牙啮咬对手。</p>
<div class="a"><p><b>疾病(特异)：</b>凶暴鼠的啮咬会传染腐热症，强韧豁免检定DC=11，潜伏期1d3天，造成1d3点敏捷伤害以及1d3点体质伤害。豁免DC的调整值与体质调整值相同。</p></div>
<div class="a"><p><b>技能：</b>凶暴鼠在进行"游泳"检定时具有+8种族加值。凶暴鼠在进行"攀爬"检定时具有+8种族加值。即使被冲撞或受威胁，他们在进行"攀爬"检定时都可以随时取10。在进行"攀爬"与"游泳"检定时，凶暴鼠以敏捷调整值取代力量调整值。</p></div>
